            {
               "text": "<ul class=\"citation\"><li><i><b>LABUTA</b></i></li><li><i>&nbsp;</i></li> <li><i>Trabalhador:</i></li> <li><i>Trabalho-e-dor</i></li> <li><i>Sangue, suor</i></li> <li><i>A ganga bruta</i></li> <li><i>A batalha cotidiana</i></li> <li><i>Nossa dura labuta</i></li> <li><i>Mudar o sistema</i></li> <li><i>Só com muita luta</i></li> </ul>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "#### Plotting the Symbol Count\n\nIn the last text of the previous chapter (<htcite0>), it was stated that when working with the real world we cannot limit multiplication to the times table of 10. In these first sections of this text we already meet a scenario that demands that expansion: to count all the letters written so far, our count cannot stop at ten.\n\nFor example, the first verse of the poem *LABUTA* holds twelve symbols: 11 letters and a colon. Let us plot them (<htcite1>; <htcite2>):",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "23ac6920-69b1-4d9c-99ef-082e387f2ddf",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Understanding the Multiplication Tables (Summary)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 0,
                     "uuid": "d41c655f-e6bf-4ac1-b720-ac9b04e6d21c",
                     "text": "Dourado, Gustavo",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2025",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "5bfa6c9e-57a7-4684-b320-373c51f0dd34",
                     "text": "Cardoso, Taunassi",
                     "page": "",
                     "date_time": {
